		"description": "<p><em>Weapon Kit — A healing kit with temp HP, burst heals, cleansing and stim options.</em></p><p><strong>Med Blaster (basic) — 1 Action.</strong> Reach 2. Target gains INT temp HP, 1 round. If they are Bloodied they regain HP instead.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt (2 Actions):</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Vital Burst.</strong> Cone 2, Restore: 2xINT HP.</li><li><strong>Cleansing Mist.</strong> Burst 2, Restore: 1d4 HP. Targets heal 1 negative condition.</li><li><strong>Stim Pack.</strong> Reach 2. Ally gains +2 speed and +1 Max Actions on their next turn. They are Dazed for 1 turn at the end of the round.</li></ul><p><strong>High Levels:</strong> +2 bonus every 5 levels (Med Blaster, Vital Burst, Cleansing Mist).</p><hr><p><em>[A] Grants the Med Kit item (basic ability, 1 Action, no scrap) and one feature per Toolbelt option (2 Actions, 1 Toolbelt scrap each, spent natively). Scraps are tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] High-level damage/healing bonuses are built into the formulas.</em></p><p><em>[M] Weapon Kits count as weapons for swapping and stowing.</em></p>",
